        "TileImage": "$($repository b8f0bf6c-4826-4de2-a785-2d139967e09c).Image",
        "Description": "Good morning 47. You will be heading to Whittleton Creek, Vermont to eliminate a series of problematic residents. The targets consist of Nolan Cassidy, who has apparently been setting up a &quot;tyrannical atmosphere&quot;, Charles Bake III, who could do more harm than good if elected , Helen West, who is rumored to use human remains in her baking, James Batty, a threat to future construction plans, and Ollive Haskel, a man infamous for inadvertently causing a young teen to commit suicide. Good luck 47.",
